{"step_index":35,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-04T23:21:35Z","thinking":"**Elevating Professionalism**\n\nI'm now diving into the user's feedback, focusing on how to achieve a more professional aesthetic for this 3D visualizer. I'm evaluating elements that would elevate it to an institutional standard, and will work to define a checklist of elements to analyze and address.\n\n\n**Defining Professional Visuals**\n\nI'm now focusing on a more sophisticated visual aesthetic. I'm prioritizing ultra-clean typography and a refined layout using dark glass UI panels with subtle metallic borders. I'm also ensuring a high-contrast typography hierarchy, with clean sans-serif headers and crisp technical data labels. I'm also considering professional statistics dashboard cards for network centrality stats and render engine status.\n\n\n**Implementing UI Enhancements**\n\nI'm now implementing interactive refinements. I'm focusing on smooth transitions for view centering and node selection, using animation when the user interacts with the UI. The pop-up modal will have a professional tabbed layout with scientific data. I will include filter tabs and network layout presets such as Poincaré Hyperbolic Sphere, and concentric orbital layers for quick visualization. Search functionality with auto-complete will also be incorporated.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Upgrades the 3D visualizer to an enterprise/scientific-grade ecological dashboard. Features smooth camera tweening, depth-fading 3D render physics, tabbed professional scientific node pop-ups, 3D layout preset engines (Hyperbolic, Force-Clustered, Concentric Rings), network density/modularity metrics, and high-precision search.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Sistema Socioecológico de Kennedy - Visualizador 3D Profesional V6</title>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    body, html {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background-color: #020306;\n      color: #f1f5f9;\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      user-select: none;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    #viewport {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      display: block;\n      cursor: crosshair;\n    }\n\n    /* Enterprise Dark Glass Panels */\n    .glass-panel {\n      background: rgba(6, 9, 15, 0.88);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);\n    }\n\n    /* Header Bar */\n    .top-header {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 12px;\n      left: 12px;\n      right: 12px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      z-index: 100;\n    }\n\n    .nav-group {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n    }\n\n    .brand-title {\n      padding: 8px 14px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n      color: #00ffff;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .btn-flat {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      color: #cbd5e1;\n      padding: 7px 12px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      transition: all 0.15s ease;\n    }\n    .btn-flat:hover {\n      background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.4);\n      color: #ffffff;\n    }\n    .btn-flat.active {\n      background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\n      border-color: #00ffff;\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n\n    /* Drawer Sidebar */\n    .side-drawer {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 62px;\n      left: 12px;\n      width: 320px;\n      max-height: calc(100vh - 130px);\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding: 14px;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n      z-index: 90;\n      transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n    }\n    .side-drawer.collapsed {\n      opacity: 0;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      transform: translateX(-12px);\n    }\n\n    .drawer-header {\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      padding-bottom: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .cat-card {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 8px 10px;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.15s ease;\n    }\n    .cat-card:hover {\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n    }\n\n    .cat-label-wrap {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .square-indicator {\n      width: 10px;\n      height: 10px;\n      border-radius: 2px;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .badge-count {\n      font-size: 9px;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      color: #00ffff;\n      font-family: monospace;\n    }\n\n    .toggle-box {\n      width: 16px;\n      height: 16px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      transition: all 0.15s;\n    }\n    .toggle-box.checked {\n      background: #00ffff;\n      border-color: #00ffff;\n    }\n    .toggle-box.checked::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      width: 6px;\n      height: 6px;\n      background: #000000;\n    }\n\n    /* Tabbed Professional Pop-Up Inspector */\n    .node-inspector {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 62px;\n      right: 12px;\n      width: 380px;\n      max-height: calc(100vh - 130px);\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding: 16px;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n      z-index: 150;\n      border-left: 4px solid #00ffff;\n      animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease-out;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes fadeIn {\n      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n    }\n\n    .inspector-header {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      padding-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .node-title {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n    .node-subtitle {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-style: italic;\n      color: #cbd5e1;\n    }\n\n    .btn-close {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      padding: 2px 8px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    .btn-close:hover {\n      color: #ffffff;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n    }\n\n    .media-preview {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 150px;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      background: #000;\n    }\n\n    .data-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .metric-card {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .metric-val {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #00ffff;\n      font-family: monospace;\n    }\n    .metric-lbl {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      color: #64748b;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .sec-header {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n      color: #64748b;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .text-content {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 8px 10px;\n      color: #cbd5e1;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .text-content.alert {\n      background: rgba(255, 0, 85, 0.08);\n      border-color: rgba(255, 0, 85, 0.3);\n      color: #ff80a0;\n    }\n\n    .neighbor-scroll {\n      max-height: 130px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .neighbor-row {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .neighbor-row:hover {\n      background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n\n    .bottom-bar {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 12px;\n      left: 12px;\n      right: 12px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      z-index: 100;\n    }\n\n    .status-badge {\n      padding: 6px 14px;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.4px;\n    }\n    .status-badge b {\n      color: #00ffff;\n      font-family: monospace;\n    }\n\n    .search-box {\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      color: #00ffff;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      outline: none;\n      width: 180px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Navigation Header -->\n  <div class=\"top-header\">\n    <div class=\"nav-group\">\n      <div class=\"glass-panel brand-title\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M12 9L19 5M12 15L5 19\"></path></svg>\n        SISTEMA SOCIOECOLÓGICO KENNEDY V6\n      </div>\n\n      <button class=\"glass-panel btn-flat active\" id=\"btnToggleSide\" onclick=\"toggleSideDrawer()\">\n        <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect></svg>\n        <span>Filtro de Capas Bióticas</span>\n      </button>\n\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"searchInput\" placeholder=\"Buscar taxón / especie...\" oninput=\"searchNode(this.value)\" class=\"glass-panel search-box\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nav-group\">\n      <button class=\"glass-panel btn-flat\" onclick=\"setLayout('hyperbolic')\">🌐 Hiperbólico</button>\n      <button class=\"glass-panel btn-flat\" onclick=\"setLayout('clustered')\">🧬 Por Grupos</button>\n      <button class=\"glass-panel btn-flat\" onclick=\"setLayout('concentric')\">🪐 Anillos</button>\n\n      <button class=\"glass-panel btn-flat active\" id=\"btnAutoRot\" onclick=\"opts.autoRotate = !opts.autoRotate; this.classList.toggle('active')\">\n        <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21.5 2v6h-6M21.34 15.57a10 10 0 1 1-.57-8.38l5.67-5.67\"></path></svg>\n        Giro 3D\n      </button>\n\n      <button class=\"glass-panel btn-flat\" onclick=\"resetCamera()\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <canvas id=\"viewport\"></canvas>\n\n  <!-- Side Drawer (Filtro por Capas Bióticas) -->\n  <div class=\"glass-panel side-drawer\" id=\"sideDrawer\">\n    <div class=\"drawer-header\">\n      <span>Capas Socioecológicas Kennedy</span>\n      <span style=\"color:#00ffff; font-size:9px;\">181 NODOS EN VIVO</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cat-card\" onclick=\"toggleCat(0)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"square-indicator\" style=\"background:#00ff88;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:600;\">Flora & Arbolado SIGAU</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:9px; color:#64748b;\">108 Taxones (Saúco, Capulí, Aliso)</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"badge-count\" id=\"badgeCat0\">108</span>\n        <div class=\"toggle-box checked\" id=\"toggleCat0\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cat-card\" onclick=\"toggleCat(1)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"square-indicator\" style=\"background:#00ffff;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:600;\">Avifauna Evaluada</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:9px; color:#64748b;\">38 Taxones (EN, VU, Migratorias)</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"badge-count\" id=\"badgeCat1\">38</span>\n        <div class=\"toggle-box checked\" id=\"toggleCat1\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cat-card\" onclick=\"toggleCat(2)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"square-indicator\" style=\"background:#ff007f;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:600;\">Microorganismos & Biota</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:9px; color:#64748b;\">15 Taxones (Bacterias, Algas, Hongos)</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"badge-count\" id=\"badgeCat2\">15</span>\n        <div class=\"toggle-box checked\" id=\"toggleCat2\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cat-card\" onclick=\"toggleCat(3)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"square-indicator\" style=\"background:#ffee33;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:600;\">Herpetos, Mamíferos & MIA</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:9px; color:#64748b;\">12 Taxones (Anfibios, Curí, Odonatos)</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"badge-count\" id=\"badgeCat3\">12</span>\n        <div class=\"toggle-box checked\" id=\"toggleCat3\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cat-card\" onclick=\"toggleCat(4)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"square-indicator\" style=\"background:#ff0033;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:600;\">Factores Abióticos & Presiones</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:9px; color:#64748b;\">7 Indicadores (Ruido, Concreto, NO2)</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"badge-count\" id=\"badgeCat4\">7</span>\n        <div class=\"toggle-box checked\" id=\"toggleCat4\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cat-card\" onclick=\"toggleCat(5)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"square-indicator\" style=\"background:#ffaa00;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:600;\">Centro Integrador Kennedy</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:9px; color:#64748b;\">1 Master Core</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"badge-count\" id=\"badgeCat5\">1</span>\n        <div class=\"toggle-box checked\" id=\"toggleCat5\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Tabbed Scientific Pop-Up Inspector -->\n  <div class=\"glass-panel node-inspector\" id=\"nodeInspector\" style=\"display:none;\">\n    <div class=\"inspector-header\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"node-title\" id=\"mNodeTitle\">Tingua bogotana</div>\n        <div class=\"node-subtitle\" id=\"mNodeSciName\">Rallus semiplumbeus</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"btn-close\" onclick=\"closeInspector()\">×</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <img id=\"mNodeImg\" src=\"\" alt=\"Fotografía / Taxón\" class=\"media-preview\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\">\n\n    <div class=\"data-grid\">\n      <div class=\"metric-card\">\n        <div class=\"metric-val\" id=\"mDegreeVal\">16</div>\n        <div class=\"metric-lbl\">Enlaces Activos</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"metric-card\">\n        <div class=\"metric-val\" id=\"mTaxaCode\">AVE-01</div>\n        <div class=\"metric-lbl\">Código Registro</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sec-header\">Rol Ecológico & Nicho</div>\n    <div class=\"text-content\" id=\"mRoleBox\">Consumidor secundario...</div>\n\n    <div class=\"sec-header\">Ubicación en Kennedy</div>\n    <div class=\"text-content\" id=\"mLocBox\">Humedal El Burro y La Vaca...</div>\n\n    <div class=\"sec-header\">Alerta Socioecológica</div>\n    <div class=\"text-content alert\" id=\"mAlertBox\">Alta (>80% abandono)...</div>\n\n    <div class=\"sec-header\" id=\"mNeighborHeader\">Interacciones Bióticas Directas</div>\n    <div class=\"neighbor-scroll\" id=\"mNeighborList\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:12px;\">\n      <button class=\"btn-flat\" style=\"flex:1; justify-content:center;\" onclick=\"focusSelectedNode()\">Centrar Cámara</button>\n      <button class=\"btn-flat\" style=\"flex:1; justify-content:center; background:rgba(0,255,255,0.15); border-color:#00ffff; color:#00ffff;\" onclick=\"closeInspector()\">Cerrar</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Bottom Bar -->\n  <div class=\"bottom-bar\">\n    <div class=\"glass-panel status-badge\">\n      Taxones Visibles: <b id=\"lblActiveNodes\">0</b> | Interacciones Activas: <b id=\"lblActiveEdges\">0</b> | Densidad Red: <b id=\"lblDensity\">0.08</b>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"glass-panel status-badge\">\n      Motor 3D Profesional • Selección de Nodo con Desenfoque de Profundidad\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    const opts = {\n      autoRotate: true,\n      showSphere: true,\n      showEdges: true,\n      pulseMotion: true,\n      layoutMode: 'hyperbolic',\n      cats: { 0: true, 1: true, 2: true, 3: true, 4: true, 5: true }\n    };\n\n    const palette = {\n      bg: '#020306',\n      sphere: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18)',\n      sphereEquator: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)',\n      edge: 'rgba(160, 32, 64, 0.55)',\n      edgeActive: '#00ffff',\n      catColors: {\n        0: '#00ff88',\n        1: '#00ffff',\n        2: '#ff007f',\n        3: '#ffee33',\n        4: '#ff0033',\n        5: '#ffaa00'\n      }\n    };\n\n    function buildFull180Dataset() {\n      const taxa = [];\n      taxa.push({ id: 'CORE-0', name: 'Sistema Socioecológico Kennedy', sciname: 'Humedales El Burro, La Vaca, Techo', cat: 5, role: 'Integración Total: Flora (108), Avifauna (38), Microorganismos (15), Herpetos & MIA (12), Factores Abióticos (7)', loc: 'Localidad de Kennedy (Bogotá)', alert: 'Red completa de enjambre V6 bajo presiones urbanas por ruido >75dB, concreto NDBI y lixiviados', img: 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Wetland_water_reflection.jpg' });\n\n      const micData = [\n        ['MIC-01', 'Nitrosomonas europaea', 'Oxidación de amonio a nitrito en biofiltro', 'Sedimento y biofiltro La Vaca / El Burro', 'Inhibido por metales pesados y lixiviados tóxicos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Nitrosomonas_europaea.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-02', 'Nitrobacter winogradskyi', 'Conversión de nitrito a nitrato (disponibilidad de N)', 'Agua y biofiltro hídrico', 'Sensible a anoxia severa y sulfuros', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Nitrobacter.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-03', 'Pseudomonas putida', 'Degradación de hidrocarburos y materia orgánica compleja', 'Agua residual urbana y sedimentos', 'Tolerante a estrés orgánico', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Pseudomonas_putida_01.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-04', 'Escherichia coli', 'Bioindicador de contaminación fecal por vertimientos', 'Cuerpos de agua El Burro y La Vaca', 'Aumenta con escorrentía sin tratar', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/EscherichiaColi_NIAID.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-05', 'Microcystis aeruginosa', 'Floración algal eutrófica, liberación de microcistinas', 'Espejo de agua estancada / El Burro', 'Estimulado por exceso de fósforo y nitrógeno', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Microcystis_aeruginosa.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-06', 'Anabaena flos-aquae', 'Fijación de nitrógeno atmosférico en florecimientos', 'Espejos hídricos eutrofizados', 'Respondedor a temperatura elevada (LST)', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Anabaena_flosaquae.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-07', 'Rhizobium leguminosarum', 'Fijación simbiótica de N2 en leguminosas nativas', 'Rizósfera de Lupinus y arbustos nativos', 'Sensible a compactación del suelo', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Rhizobium_leguminosarum.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-08', 'Trichoderma harzianum', 'Descomposición de hojarasca y protección radicular', 'Suelo orgánico bajo bosque melífero', 'Requiere humedad y materia orgánica', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Trichoderma_harzianum.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-09', 'Gomphonema parvulum', 'Bioindicador de calidad hídrica y base trófica', 'Superficie de tallos de Typha y Schoenoplectus', 'Resistente a niveles moderados de polución', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Gomphonema.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-10', 'Chlorella vulgaris', 'Producción de oxígeno disuelto y fijación de CO2', 'Columna de agua de los humedales', 'Sensible a herbicidas y sombra densa', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Chlorella_vulgaris.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-11', 'Spirulina platensis', 'Producción primaria alta en agua alcalina', 'Remansos de agua con nutrientes', 'Indicador de carga orgánica alta', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Arthrospira_platensis.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-12', 'Methanosarcina barkeri', 'Producción de metano en sedimentos anóxicos', 'Fango bentónico profundo de La Vaca', 'Inhibida por oxigenación hídrica', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Methanosarcina.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-13', 'Bacillus subtilis', 'Solubilización de fósforo y solubilidad de micronutrientes', 'Suelo de ronda en restauración', 'Alta resistencia por endosporas', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Bacillus_subtilis.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-14', 'Glomus intraradices', 'Facilita absorción hídrica y de P en plantas de ronda', 'Raíces de Aliso, Capulí y Saúco', 'Destruido por labranza y compactación', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Mycorrhiza_fungus.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-15', 'Agaricus campestris', 'Descomposición de materia orgánica vegetal en ronda', 'Praderas y humedales de borde', 'Sensible a plaguicidas urbanos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Agaricus_campestris.jpg']\n      ];\n      micData.forEach(m => taxa.push({ id: m[0], name: m[1], sciname: m[1], cat: 2, role: m[2], loc: m[3], alert: m[4], img: m[5] }));\n\n      const herpData = [\n        ['HERP-01', 'Rana sabanera', 'Dendropsophus labialis', 'Consumidor secundario / Bioindicador hídrico', 'Ronda hidráulica El Burro / La Vaca', 'Renacuajos comen algas; adultos consumen insectos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Dendropsophus_labialis.jpg'],\n        ['HERP-02', 'Culebra sabanera', 'Atractus crassicaudatus', 'Depredador de suelo / Control de invertebrados', 'Pastizales de ronda ZMPA', 'Amenazada por gatos y corte de pasto', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Atractus_crassicaudatus.jpg'],\n        ['MAM-01', 'Chucurí / Comadreja', 'Mustela frenata', 'Depredador tope de ronda / Control de roedores', 'Matorrales densos El Burro y Techo', 'Requiere refugio en saucales', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Mustela_frenata.jpg'],\n        ['MAM-02', 'Curí silvestre', 'Cavia anolaimae', 'Herbívoro / Dispersor de semillas de pastos nativos', 'Praderas emergentes de borde', 'Depredación por perros sinantrópicos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Cavia_porcellus_wild.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-01', 'Libélula sabanera', 'Aeshna intorta', 'Depredador acuático / Bioindicador de O2', 'Espejo hídrico bien oxigenado El Burro', 'Larvas comen dípteros; adultos cazan moscas', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Aeshna_cyanea_01.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-02', 'Quironómido (Gusano rojo)', 'Chironomus sp.', 'Colector-recogedor / Bioindicador de eutrofización', 'Sedimento anóxico de La Vaca y El Burro', 'Base trófica principal para Tingua bogotana', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Chironomus_plumosus.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-03', 'Caracol pliego', 'Physa acuta', 'Raspador de perifiton / Detritívoro', 'Tallo de junco (Schoenoplectus) y enea', 'Alimento para fochas, tinguas y garzas', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Physa_acuta.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-04', 'Camarón de agua dulce', 'Hyalella azteca', 'Fragmentador de hojarasca / Detritívoro bentónico', 'Bentos hídrico con hojarasca de Aliso', 'Alimento clave para patos acuáticos y renacuajos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Hyalella_azteca.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-05', 'Sanguijuela de agua dulce', 'Helobdella stagnalis', 'Carroñero / Depredador de invertebrados', 'Limo orgánico denso en zonas de vertimiento', 'Indicador de alta carga orgánica particulada', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Helobdella_stagnalis.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-06', 'Chinche nadador', 'Buenoa sp.', 'Depredador de columna de agua', 'Espejo de agua abierto sin corriente', 'Controlador de larvas de mosquitos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Notonecta_glauca.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-07', 'Caballito de delgada cola', 'Ischnura ramburii', 'Depredador de perifiton y microartrópodos', 'Vegetación flotante (Azolla, Eichhornia)', 'Indicador de vegetación hídrica bien estructurada', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Ischnura_ramburii.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-08', 'Gusano de fango', 'Tubifex tubifex', 'Detritívoro de fondo / Tolerante a anoxia', 'Sedimento contaminado con lixiviados', 'Indicador extremo de polución hídrica', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Tubifex_tubifex.jpg']\n      ];\n      herpData.forEach(h => taxa.push({ id: h[0], name: h[1], sciname: h[2], cat: 3, role: h[3], loc: h[4], alert: h[5], img: h[6] }));\n\n      const aveList = [\n        ['AVE-01', 'Tingua bogotana', 'Rallus semiplumbeus', 'En Peligro (EN) - Endémica', 'Humedal El Burro y La Vaca', 'Alta (>80% abandono por ruido >75dB)', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Rallus_semiplumbeus.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-02', 'Cucarachero de pantano', 'Cistothorus apolinari', 'En Peligro (EN) - Endémico', 'Humedal El Burro (Sector Norte)', 'Muy Alta (Inhibición de canto de cortejo)', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Cistothorus_apolinari.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-03', 'Monjita cabeciamarilla', 'Chrysomus icterocephalus', 'Vulnerable (VU) - Subesp. Endémica', 'Humedal La Vaca y Techo', 'Alta sensibilidad a pérdida de Juncales', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Chrysomus_icterocephalus.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-04', 'Pato andino', 'Oxyura ferruginea', 'Vulnerable (VU) / Malacófago', 'Espejo hídrico abierto El Burro', 'Sensible a contaminación con plásticos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Oxyura_jamaicensis_rubida.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-05', 'Tingua azul', 'Porphyrio martinica', 'Residente / Protegida', 'El Burro, La Vaca, Techo', 'Sensible a perros y gatos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Porphyrio_martinicus.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-06', 'Tingua gris / Polla de agua', 'Gallinula galeata', 'Residente abundante / Herbívora', 'El Burro y La Vaca', 'Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Gallinula_galeata.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-07', 'Focha americana', 'Fulica americana', 'Residente acuática / Algas', 'Espejos de agua El Burro', 'Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Fulica_americana.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-08', 'Pisingo', 'Dendrocygna autumnalis', 'Residente local / Granívoro', 'Pastizales de ronda El Burro', 'Alta', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Dendrocygna_autumnalis.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-09', 'Zambullidor piquigrueso', 'Podilymbus podiceps', 'Residente acuático / Piscívoro', 'Humedal El Burro', 'Alta', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Podilymbus_podiceps.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-10', 'Coquito', 'Phimosus infuscatus', 'Residente litoraleño / Invertebrados', 'Bordes fangosos La Vaca y Techo', 'Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Phimosus_infuscatus.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-11', 'Garza real', 'Egretta thula', 'Residente / Depredadora en Sauce', 'Ronda hídrica El Burro', 'Media', 'https://commo